auto-transcriber (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Switch from the deprecated google-generativeai SDK to google-genai
    (still uploads audio through the File API, so long recordings work).
    postinst removes google-generativeai from the existing venv.
  * Default model is now gemini-3.5-flash; the model can be chosen in
    Settings (gemini-3.5/3.6/3.7/3.8-flash or any typed-in model id).
  * New tray icon: sound wave turning into text; the state is shown by
    shape (lines / dots / cross) and the icon is drawn at every tray size.
  * Optional monochrome tray icon that follows the KDE light/dark color
    scheme (or a fixed light/dark glyph), configurable in Settings.

 -- Ilshat Minnibaev <ilshatminnibaev@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:05:37 +0200

auto-transcriber (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild the venv when the system Python minor version changes
    (postinst + dpkg trigger on /usr/bin/python3); fixes startup after
    upgrading to Ubuntu 26.04 (Python 3.12 -> 3.14).
  * Launcher reports a stale venv with a desktop notification.
  * Wayland: set the desktop file name so KWin matches windows and
    notifications to auto-transcriber.desktop.

 -- Ilshat Minnibaev <ilshatminnibaev@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:00:00 +0200

